MID_SC15_08_m01: <TH>
MID_SC15_08_m01_001: Qui es-tu ? Tu es le guerrier le plus redoutable\nque j'aie jamais affronté.
MID_SC15_08_m01_002: Quand on veut échanger entre guerriers,\non fait causer ses armes.
MID_SC15_08_m01_003: Allez, viens, Démon Chenu, qu'on ait\nune petite discussion !
MID_SC15_08_m02: 
MID_SC15_08_m02_001: 
MID_SC15_08_m02_002: 
MID_SC15_08_m02_003: 
MID_SC15_08_m02_004: 
MID_SC15_08_m03: 
MID_SC15_08_m03_001: 
MID_SC15_08_m04: 
MID_SC15_08_m04_001: 
MID_SC15_08_m05: 
MID_SC15_08_m05_001: 
MID_SC15_08_m06: 
MID_SC15_08_m06_001: 
MID_SC15_08_m07: 
MID_SC15_08_m07_001: 
MID_SC15_08_m07_002: 
MID_SC15_08_m07_003: 
MID_SC15_08_m07_004: 
MID_SC15_08_m07_005: 
MID_SC15_08_m08: 
MID_SC15_08_m08_001: 
MID_SC15_08_m08_002: C'est la voix de... Gilchris. Et Aswan est avec lui !
MID_SC15_08_m08_003: Oui c'est ça, ne quitte surtout pas l'assistance\ndes yeux. Une stratégie gagnante s'il en est...
MID_SC15_08_m09: 
MID_SC15_08_m09_001: 
MID_SC15_08_m09_002: 
MID_SC15_08_m09_003: 
MID_SC15_08_m09_004: 
MID_SC15_08_m11: 
MID_SC15_08_m09_005: 
MID_SC15_08_m09_006: 
MID_SC15_08_m10: <TH>
MID_SC15_08_m10_001: C'est comme si... une sorte de lien\ntrès étrange nous unissait.
MID_SC15_08_m10_002: Qui es-tu, à la fin ?
MID_SC15_08_m10_003: Le type qui va te battre.
MID_SC15_08_e01: 
MID_SC15_08_e01_001: 
MID_SC15_08_e01_002: 
MID_SC15_08_e01_003: 
MID_SC15_08_e01_004: 
MID_SC15_08_e01_005: 
MID_SC15_08_e01_006: 
MID_SC15_08_e02: 
MID_SC15_08_e02_001: 
MID_SC15_08_e03: 
MID_SC15_08_e03_001: 
MID_SC15_08_e04: 
MID_SC15_08_e04_001: 
MID_SC15_08_e05: 
MID_SC15_08_e05_001: 
MID_SC15_08_e06: 
MID_SC15_08_e06_001: 
MID_SC15_08_e07: 
MID_SC15_08_e07_001: 
MID_SC15_09_m01: <TH>
MID_SC15_09_m01_001: Je m'excuse d'avance, car ce combat sera douloureux.\nJ'ai tendance à me montrer impitoyable.
MID_SC15_09_m01_002: Ce n'est rien. Je n'ai jamais imploré\nla pitié d'un adversaire.
MID_SC15_09_m01_003: Au cours de ce combat, il est fort probable\nque vous finissiez par le regretter !
MID_SC15_09_m02: <TH>
MID_SC15_09_m02_001: J'ose espérer que tu es en forme\naujourd'hui, Démon Chenu.
MID_SC15_09_m03: 
MID_SC15_09_m03_001: 
MID_SC15_09_m03_002: 
MID_SC15_09_m03_003: 
MID_SC15_09_m03_004: 
MID_SC15_09_m04: 
MID_SC15_09_m04_001: 
MID_SC15_09_m04_002: 
MID_SC15_09_m04_003: 
MID_SC15_09_m05: 
MID_SC15_09_m05_001: 
MID_SC15_09_m06: 
MID_SC15_09_m06_001: 
MID_SC15_09_m06_002: 
MID_SC15_09_m07: 
MID_SC15_09_m07_001: 
MID_SC15_09_m07_002: 
MID_SC15_09_m08: <TH>
MID_SC15_09_m08_001: Préparez-vous à mourir, Démon Chenu !
MID_SC15_09_m08_002: Je ne vois vraiment pas ce que j'ai fait\npour susciter une telle rancune.
MID_SC15_09_m09: 
MID_SC15_09_m09_001: 
MID_SC15_09_m10: <TH>
MID_SC15_09_m10_001: Je ne puis me permettre d'échouer si lamentablement\nsous les yeux de Dame Iliana. Je le refuse.
MID_SC15_09_m10_002: Vous le refusez peut-être, mais c'est ce qui est\nen train de se passer. Vous êtes trop faible.
MID_SC15_09_m10_003: Oooh...
MID_SC15_09_m10_004: Mais vous êtes... Oh.
MID_SC15_09_m10_005: Eh bien si ce n'est pas du dévouement... Il est encore\ndebout alors qu'il vient de perdre connaissance.
MID_SC15_09_e01: 
MID_SC15_09_e01_001: 
MID_SC15_09_e02: 
MID_SC15_09_e02_001: 
MID_SC15_09_e03: 
